    cde:designNote "Acuity is the question in trauma: acute, healing, healed, or of indeterminate age. Displacement and comminution matter far less. Plurality is the unhandled part: reports say 'fractures of the left fourth through seventh ribs' and the model has no way to hold a set." ;
    cde:lastModified "2026-09-10"^^xsd:date ;
    cde:localId "FC-000037" ;
