        owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:comment "Inverse of hasComponent. Functional: a sub-finding with no standalone meaning belongs to exactly one whole. This is what lets a conditional relationship be carried on the component rather than asserted as a requirement on the whole." ;
